n="2:27.382" end="2:28.825">chest</span></p><p begin="2:29.175" end="2:37.196" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:29.175" end="2:29.622">I</span> <span begin="2:29.622" end="2:29.972">rise,</span> <span begin="2:29.972" end="2:30.355">I</span> <span begin="2:30.355" end="2:31.080">rise</span> <span begin="2:31.080" end="2:31.430">no</span> <span begin="2:31.430" end="2:32.446">matter</span> <span begin="2:32.446" end="2:32.882">what</span> <span begin="2:33.132" end="2:33.841">they</span> <span begin="2:33.841" end="2:34.325">say,</span> <span begin="2:34.325" end="2:34.692">I</span> <span begin="2:34.692" end="2:35.341">burn</span> <span begin="2:35.341" end="2:35.728">fear</span> <span begin="2:35.728" end="2:37.196">away</span></p><p begin="2:37.196" end="2:42.248" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:37.196" end="2:37.584">I</span> <span begin="2:37.584" end="2:38.606">rise,</span> <span begin="2:38.606" end="2:39.022">I</span> <span begin="2:39.022" end="2:42.248">rise</span></p></div><div begin="2:41.699" end="2:53.575" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v3"><p begin="2:41.699" end="2:44.953" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="2:41.699" end="2:43.269">在观过世界后的二十</span><span begin="2:43.269" end="2:43.509">八</span><span begin="2:43.509" end="2:44.415">是十八岁的</span><span begin="2:44.415" end="2:44.707">财</span><span begin="2:44.707" end="2:44.953">富</span></p><p begin="2:44.953" end="2:47.798" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="2:44.953" end="2:46.409">但十八岁的世界观</span><span begin="2:46.409" end="2:47.275">是二十八的</span><span begin="2:47.275" end="2:47.511">来</span><span begin="2:47.511" end="2:47.798">路</span></p><p begin="2:47.883" end="2:50.669" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="2:47.883" end="2:49.112">如果有无形的手</span><span begin="2:49.112" end="2:50.161">对这一切进行</span><span begin="2:50.161" end="2:50.400">排</span><span begin="2:50.400" end="2:50.669">布</span></p><p begin="2:50.735" end="2:53.575" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="2:50.735" end="2:51.986">是信了还是不幸</span><span begin="2:51.986" end="2:53.062">才会中了那些</span><span begin="2:53.062" end="2:53.297">埋</span><span begin="2:53.297" end="2:53.575">伏</span></p></div><div begin="2:53.581" end="3:05.377" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v3"><p begin="2:53.581" end="2:56.198" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="2:53.581" end="2:54.721">蛇每脱一次皮</span><span begin="2:54.721" end="2:55.616">又代表长大</span><span begin="2:55.616" end="2:55.816">一</span><span begin="2:55.816" end="2:56.198">些</span></p><p begin="2:56.281" end="2:59.365" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="2:56.281" end="2:57.778">每次开了新的眼界</span><span begin="2:57.778" end="2:59.061">又多度了一次蜜</span><span begin="2:59.061" end="2:59.365">月</span></p><p begin="2:59.435" end="3:02.213" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="2:59.435" end="3:01.004">对这个世界一直不断</span><span begin="3:01.004" end="3:01.966">刷新我的理</span><span begin="3:01.966" end="3:02.213">解</span></p><p begin="3:02.313" end="3:05.377" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:02.313" end="3:03.373">在离开学校后</span><span begin="3:03.373" end="3:04.672">又经历无数次的</span><span begin="3:04.672" end="3:05.028">毕</span><span begin="3:05.028" end="3:05.377">业</span></p></div><div begin="3:05.377" end="3:16.788" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v3"><p begin="3:05.377" end="3:08.022" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:05.377" end="3:05.784">Man</span> <span begin="3:06.285" end="3:07.520">都是要去往同个</span><span begin="3:07.520" end="3:07.737">地</span><span begin="3:07.737" end="3:08.022">方</span></p><p begin="3:08.069" end="3:10.897" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:08.069" end="3:09.348">总有些路段丝滑</span><span begin="3:09.348" end="3:10.438">有些麻烦无法</span><span begin="3:10.438" end="3:10.605">避</span><span begin="3:10.605" end="3:10.897">让</span></p><p begin="3:10.994" end="3:13.818" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:10.994" end="3:12.420">有时像泄了气的皮</span><span begin="3:12.420" end="3:12.557">球</span><span begin="3:12.557" end="3:13.555">有时充满力</span><span begin="3:13.555" end="3:13.818">量</span></p><p begin="3:13.985" end="3:16.788" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:13.985" end="3:14.929">总是在回头看</span><span begin="3:14.929" end="3:16.233">才发现原来早有</span><span begin="3:16.233" end="3:16.488">迹</span><span begin="3:16.488" end="3:16.788">象</span></p></div><div begin="3:16.788" end="3:28.533" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v3"><p begin="3:16.788" end="3:19.834" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:16.788" end="3:17.299">世界很</span><span begin="3:17.299" end="3:17.732">大</span> <span begin="3:17.897" end="3:19.469">想找的怎麼找都找不</span><span begin="3:19.469" end="3:19.834">到</span></p><p begin="3:19.905" end="3:22.761" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:19.905" end="3:20.714">世界又很</span><span begin="3:20.714" end="3:20.896">小</span><span begin="3:20.896" end="3:22.334">小到怎麼躲也躲不</span><span begin="3:22.334" end="3:22.761">掉</span></p><p begin="3:22.949" end="3:25.468" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:22.949" end="3:23.934">总有人告诉我</span><span begin="3:23.934" end="3:25.296">说那是条崎岖的</span><span begin="3:25.296" end="3:25.468">路</span></p><p begin="3:25.468" end="3:28.533" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:25.468" end="3:27.231">但有些跟头我不自己摔</span><span begin="3:27.231" end="3:28.180">又怎麼记得</span><span begin="3:28.180" end="3:28.533">住</span></p></div><div begin="3:28.708" end="3:39.925" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v3"><p begin="3:28.708" end="3:31.147" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:28.708" end="3:30.297">所以我屏蔽那些建议</span> <span begin="3:30.297" end="3:30.639">那些</span><span begin="3:30.639" end="3:30.844">忠</span><span begin="3:30.844" end="3:31.147">告</span></p><p begin="3:31.193" end="3:34.044" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:31.193" end="3:32.472">独行的海鸟必须</span><span begin="3:32.472" end="3:33.553">带着倔强穿过</span><span begin="3:33.553" end="3:33.796">风</span><span begin="3:33.796" end="3:34.044">暴</span></p><p begin="3:34.109" end="3:36.960" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:34.109" end="3:35.380">跟自己天人交战</span><span begin="3:35.380" end="3:36.470">这场仗我必须</span><span begin="3:36.470" end="3:36.960">赢</span></p><p begin="3:37.231" end="3:39.925" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="3:37.231" end="3:37.885">你知道的</span><span begin="3:37.885" end="3:39.320">不到终点之前不能</span><span begin="3:39.320" end="3:39.925">停</span></p></div><div begin="3:38.580" end="4:03.053" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="3:38.580" end="3:43.298" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:38.580" end="3:39.034">I</span> <span begin="3:39.034" end="3:39.416">rise,</span> <span begin="3:39.416" end="3:39.783">I</span> <span begin="3:39.783" end="3:40.416">rise,</span> <span begin="3:40.416" end="3:40.798">I</span> <span begin="3:40.798" end="3:41.166">won't</span> <span begin="3:41.166" end="3:41.756">be</span> <span begin="3:41.874" end="3:42.264">like</span> <span begin="3:42.264" end="3:42.631">the</span> <span begin="3:42.631" end="3:43.298">rest</span></p><p begin="3:44.359" end="3:49.797" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:44.359" end="3:44.816">I</span> <span begin="3:44.816" end="3:45.173">rise</span> <span begin="3:45.173" end="3:45.524">through</span> <span begin="3:45.524" end="3:46.265">storms</span> <span begin="3:46.265" end="3:46.565">with</span> <span begin="3:46.565" end="3:47.389">fire</span> <span begin="3:47.683" end="3:48.041">in</span> <span begin="3:48.041" end="3:48.424">my</span> <span begin="3:48.424" end="3:49.797">chest</span></p><p begin="3:50.114" end="3:58.135" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:50.114" end="3:50.561">I</span> <span begin="3:50.561" end="3:50.911">rise,</span> <span begin="3:50.911" end="3:51.294">I</span> <span begin="3:51.294" end="3:52.019">rise</span> <span begin="3:52.019" end="3:52.369">no</span> <span b